{"id":"u-4c4f82e9-428c-4c0e-8945-8526fa27946f","src":"community","title":"Stellar Strength and Health Program","author":"Aira Jaey  T.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/6tPa81-stellar-strength-and-health-program","desc":"Why I Work Out\n\nFor almost three and a half years, I was in a relationship where I slowly lost myself.\n\nI was overweight, struggling with PCOS, and often felt weak and helpless in my own body. There were days when my back pain was so severe that I couldn't walk for three days. I remember crying from the pain and feeling completely defeated.\n\nThere was a time when I asked the person I loved for help because I was hurting, but instead of feeling cared for, I felt like I was asking for too much.\n\nThat became one of the moments that made me realize I needed to choose myself.\n\nSo I found the courage to leave, and I made myself a promise:\n\nNever again will I allow myself to feel helpless, unhealthy, and hopeless.\n\nThat's why I work out.\n\nI'm not doing this for anyone else. I'm doing this because I want to become stronger, healthier, more confident, and more independent.\n\nEvery workout is a reminder that I am choosing myself again.\n\nEvery difficult day is proof that I'm becoming stronger than the person I used to be.\n\nThis journey isn't just about changing my body.\n\nIt's about rebuilding myself.\n\nI want to be able to move without fear, take care of myself, and feel proud of the person I'm becoming.\n\nI may have started this journey because I was tired of feeling weak.\n\nBut I'm continuing because I know I deserve to feel strong.\n\nI deserve to feel healthy.\n\nI deserve to feel capable.\n\nAnd most importantly, I deserve a life where I never feel helpless again.\n\nThis time, I'm choosing me.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Women's","Muscle","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-15T13:06:40.001Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Shoulders + 